      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Blushing"
    },
    {
      "index": 2,
      "simplified": "昨天老公朋友生日，大家一起去唱KTV。",
      "traditional": "昨天老公朋友生日，大家一起去唱KTV。",
      "pinyin": "zuó tiān lǎo gōng péng you shēng rì dà jiā yì qǐ qù chàng K T V",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 3,
      "simplified": "\n    ",
      "traditional": "\n    ",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Yesterday was my husband's friend's birthday, and we all went to sing karaoke."
    },
    {
      "index": 4,
      "simplified": "玩得正高兴，老公突然指着旁边的一个小女生对我说：",
      "traditional": "玩得正高興，老公突然指著旁邊的一個小女生對我說：",
      "pinyin": "wán de zhèng gāo xìng lǎo gōng tū rán zhǐ zhe páng biān de yí ge xiǎo nǚ shēng duì wǒ shuō",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 5,
      "simplified": "“看，那就是当年的你。一身白色的长裙，听到什么都会害羞得脸红。”",
      "traditional": "“看，那就是當年的你。一身白色的長裙，聽到什麼都會害羞得臉紅。”",
      "pinyin": "kàn nà jiù shì dāng nián de nǐ yì shēn bái sè de cháng qún tīng dào shén me dōu huì hài xiū de liǎn hóng",
      "english": "When we were having the most fun, my husband suddenly pointed to a young girl next to us and said:"
    },
    {
      "index": 6,
      "simplified": "\n    ",
      "traditional": "\n    ",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "“Look, it's just like you back then. Wearing a long white skirt, and blushes whenever anyone says something”"
    },
    {
      "index": 7,
      "simplified": "我好奇地问：“那现在的我呢？”",
      "traditional": "我好奇地問：“那現在的我呢？”",
      "pinyin": "wǒ hào qí de wèn nà xiàn zài de wǒ ne",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 8,
      "simplified": "\n    ",
      "traditional": "\n    ",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Curious I asked: “What about me now?”"
    },
    {
      "index": 9,
      "simplified": "老公叹了一口气说：“现在的你说什么都能让别人脸红！”",
      "traditional": "老公嘆了一口氣說：“現在的你說什麼都能讓別人臉紅！”",
      "pinyin": "lǎo gōng tàn le yì kǒu qì shuō xiàn zài de nǐ shuō shén me dōu néng ràng bié ren liǎn hóng",
      "english": ""
    }
  ],
