      "Blushing",
      "",
      "Yesterday was my husband's friend's birthday, and we all went to sing karaoke.",
      "",
      "When we were having the most fun, my husband suddenly pointed to a young girl next to us and said:",
      "“Look, it's just like you back then. Wearing a long white skirt, and blushes whenever anyone says something”",
      "",
      "Curious I asked: “What about me now?”",
      "",
      "My husband sighed and said: “Nowadays, no matter what you say you make other people blush”"
